https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=20785100","site":"Hacker News","score":133,"comments":165,"year":2019},{"title":"Vaping Illnesses Are Linked to Vitamin E Acetate, CDC Says","url":"https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=21491723","site":"Hacker News","score":130,"comments":139,"year":2019},{"title":"Facebook approves alcohol, vaping and gambling ads targeting 13-17 year olds","url":"https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=26964249","site":"Hacker News","score":173,"comments":92,"year":2021},{"title":"FDA is considering drugs to help kids quit vaping","url":"https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=18941080","site":"Hacker News","score":61,"comments":193,"year":2019},{"title":"Vaping-related lung injuries primarily linked to black-market products","url":"https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=22071611","site":"Hacker News","score":161,"comments":81,"year":2020},{"title":"Wisconsin Officials Urge People to Stop Vaping After Sudden Rise in Lung Disease","url":"https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=20598953","site":"Hacker News","score":130,"comments":98,"year":2019},{"title":"NYT and vaping: How to lie by saying only true things (2022)","url":"https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=48155555","site":"Hacker News","score":127,"comments":82,"year":2026},{"title":"Vaping Is big tobacco’s bait and switch","url":"https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=19356159","site":"Hacker News","score":85,"comments":122,"year":2019},{"title":"Osaka bans smoking on all of its streets, vaping included","url":"https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=42852073","site":"Hacker News","score":114,"comments":78,"year":2025}],"web":[{"title":"Smoker's face - Wikipedia","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Smoker%27s_face"}]},"angle":{"goal":"Anti-aging","effect":"indirect","chain":["Less tobacco and nicotine exposure","Better skin blood flow and collagen","Brighter, less wrinkled complexion"],"text":"Quitting tobacco or vaping is cited to avoid or reduce smoker's face, with its wrinkles, sagging and dull yellowish complexion. Less tobacco and nicotine exposure means better skin blood flow and collagen, and a brighter, less wrinkled complexion. The link between smoking and facial aging comes from observational research."},"wikipedia":null,"grokipedia":null,"lead":["In looksmaxxing and skincare discussions, quitting smoking or vaping is cited as a way to avoid or slow smoking-related facial aging. 'Smoker's face' is the term for facial changes seen in many long-term smokers, including a pattern of wrinkles, sagging and a dull, yellowish or grayish complexion [1].","Medical sources attribute these changes to reduced oxygen and nutrient supply, breakdown of the skin's structural matrix, and oxidative stress [1]. No trials of quitting for appearance were found in the sources reviewed, and no studies of vaping and facial aging were found."],"infobox":[["Type","Lifestyle change"],["Related term","Smoker's face"],["Claimed benefit","Slower facial aging, better skin tone"],["Evidence for appearance","Observational, as summarised in encyclopedic sources"]],"sections":[{"h":"Smoker's face","paras":["Wikipedia describes smoker's face as the distinctive changes in many tobacco smokers: wrinkling, sagging, premature aging, a grayish tone and higher skin cancer risk, along with hair loss and oral effects such as gum disease and staining [1]. A study it cites, a 1985 BMJ article, found characteristic features in about 46% of current smokers and 8% of former smokers with a decade of smoking, and none in non-smokers [1]."],"subs":[]},{"h":"Proposed mechanisms","paras":["The cited mechanisms include increased enzymes that break down the extracellular matrix (collagen, elastin and proteoglycans), reduced antioxidants such as vitamin C, narrowing of facial blood vessels by tobacco chemicals, and a build-up of free radicals leading to oxidative stress, considered a form of extrinsic aging [1]."],"subs":[]},{"h":"Vaping","paras":["No studies of vaping and facial appearance were found in the sources reviewed."],"subs":[]},{"h":"Clinical studies","paras":["No studies found on quitting smoking or vaping with facial appearance as the outcome. The relevant evidence is observational research on smokers' skin, as summarised above [1]."],"subs":[]}],"lore":null,"timeline":[{"year":"1985","event":"BMJ study on facial features in smokers cited in encyclopedic summaries [1]"}],"refs":[{"title":"Smoker's face","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Smoker%27s_face","source":"Wikipedia","year":2025,"type":"encyclopedia"}],"studies":[{"title":"Smoker's face","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Smoker%27s_face","source":"Wikipedia","year":2025,"kind":null}],"reddit":[],"forums":[{"title":"vaping and nicotine is a wonder drug","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/vaping-and-nicotine-is-a-wonder-drug.1597435/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20251117041002/https://looksmax.org/threads/vaping-and-nicotine-is-a-wonder-drug.1597435/"},{"title":"Vaping is the ultimate lean maxing method","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/vaping-is-the-ultimate-lean-maxing-method.1575043/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20251215225718/https://looksmax.org/threads/vaping-is-the-ultimate-lean-maxing-method.1575043/"},{"title":"vaping is such a life-hack","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/vaping-is-such-a-life-hack.1462141/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20250804055745/https://looksmax.org/threads/vaping-is-such-a-life-hack.1462141/"},{"title":"vaping smoking has been a great leanmaxxing tool for me","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/vaping-smoking-has-been-a-great-leanmaxxing-tool-for-me.466583/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20220307033117/https://looksmax.org/threads/vaping-smoking-has-been-a-great-leanmaxxing-tool-for-me.466583/"},{"title":"does vaping smoking stunt height growth and developing","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/does-vaping-smoking-stunt-height-gro